>More Basic Evaluation Functions</SectionComponent>
<p>With the simplest evaluation functions done, we can now focus on the <strong>test evaluation logic</strong> itself.</p>
<SectionComponent tag="h2" 
  id="the-ast-of-the-test-model-unit-2"
  bind:intersecting={visibleById["the-ast-of-the-test-model-unit-2"]}
